  "name": "Digital Leads Co — Australia Plumbing Audit-Led Cold Call Book",
  "description": "Australian-market consultative cold-call playbook for plumbing businesses. The caller brings a concise public GBP + website review to every call, uses verified observations to open a relevant conversation, qualifies business priorities, then routes the prospect to the smallest suitable Digital Leads Co package. Primary cold-call goal: secure permission for a short audit / preview walkthrough or a specifically agreed follow-up — not force a sale on the first call. Includes decision-maker and gatekeeper paths, discovery, all current packages and prices, objection handling, compliance and no-contact handling.",
