      "script": "“Based on what you've told me, I wouldn't automatically recommend the biggest package. The sensible option depends on what's already working and what needs fixing.\n\nFrom what you've described, the closest fit looks like [package]. The reason is [their stated problem] — not just because it's a service we sell.\n\nWould it help if I quickly explained what that includes and what it doesn't?”",
      "internalNote": "PACKAGE FIT RULES:\n• Free Growth Preview (A$0): selected qualified businesses only; brief snapshot + personalised homepage concept / before-after preview. This is not the full SEO audit and includes no implementation.\n• Complete Local SEO Audit (A$299 one-off): prospect wants diagnosis, competitor view, technical / keyword / content findings and a prioritised 30/60/90-day plan; no implementation included.\n• Website Launch (A$1,990 one-off): needs a professional replacement / first website up to 5 pages; basic on-page SEO and tracking setup, but not the broader GBP and local SEO implementation of Foundation.\n• Local Visibility Foundation (A$3,490 one-off): needs a website plus local SEO foundation, up to 10 pages, 5 service pages, 3 location pages, one GBP location, citations, tracking.\n• Local Market Expansion (from A$5,490 one-off): existing established business expanding across more services / locations; larger content and local SEO scope up to 15 pages, 7 location pages, 5 service pages, 2 case studies.\n• Local Care (A$149/month): existing site is broadly fine; needs maintenance, security / backup / uptime checks and minor updates. Not an SEO growth retainer.\n• Local SEO Growth (A$749/month): existing site / foundation is in place and prospect wants ongoing monthly technical monitoring, GBP maintenance, up to 5 keywords, one substantial content/page optimisation per month.\n• Local SEO Expansion (A$1,149/month): more competitive multi-service / multi-suburb growth, up to 10 keyword targets and up to two substantial monthly page/content improvements.\n• Business Growth Automation (custom quote): enquiry routing, centralised leads, quote reminders, status tracking, review workflows, CRM integrations. Scope technically before promising anything.\n\nDon't stack services unnecessarily. A one-off website / local SEO foundation and a monthly retainer solve different jobs. Monthly SEO is not a guaranteed ranking service. A$ prices are the supplied list prices; confirm GST treatment, third-party costs, exclusions, and final scope in writing rather than assuming they are included.",
